Wooden Hopper - unofficial Fabric 1.20.1 port
===============================================

This repository is an unofficial backport of "Wooden Hopper" by cech12
(https://github.com/cech12/WoodenHopper) from Minecraft 1.20.4 to
Minecraft 1.20.1 on Fabric.

It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the original author.
Only version/loader compatibility was changed; gameplay, balance, models,
textures, sounds, translations and recipes are taken unchanged from the
upstream project. AI assistance was used during the porting work.

The original work is licensed under the MIT License and the original
copyright notice is preserved verbatim below. Changes made for this port are
released under the same MIT License.

Original copyright: Copyright (c) 2021 cech12
Port changes:       Copyright (c) 2026 the contributors of this port

